've turned the east rows twice this week and the soil is still hard. Other years it would be loose by now.","zh":"东边那几垄我这礼拜翻了两遍，土还是硬邦邦的。往年这时候早就松了。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The snow on the heights is late melting this year. The sheep still can't get up to the high pasture, so they're on hay.","zh":"山上的雪今年化得晚，羊到现在还上不了高处的草场，只能喂干草。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk0.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk1","type":"actor/person/elder","name":{"en":"Clara Lilymere","zh":"克拉拉·百合湖"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.highmoor","x":6,"y":14},"facing":"down","props":{"age":65,"household":"altar.highmoor.h0","purse":4,"favourite":"item/misc/dice"},"contents":["altar.highmoor.folk1.coin0","altar.highmoor.folk1.coin1","altar.highmoor.folk1.coin2","altar.highmoor.folk1.coin3"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.tied","face":"face.weary","age":"age.lined","hat":"hat.cap","outfit":"outfit.dress","shoes":"shoes.tall"},"colors":{"skin":"warm","hair":"silver","eyes":"bark","hat.1":"woad","outfit.1":"mustard","outfit.2":"undyed","shoes.1":"black"}},"npc":{"role":"elder","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":6,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-1","x":2,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":6,"to":12,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":6,"y":14,"activity":"sit"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-1","x":4,"y":3,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":6,"y":14,"activity":"sit"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":16,"y":19,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"When I was small, at this time of year it was still light after supper, and we would play outside a good while. Now it's dark before supper is even cooked.","zh":"我小时候，这个时节吃完晚饭天还亮着，我们还能在外面玩好一阵。现在饭还没做好，天就黑了。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The snow on the heights is late melting this year. The sheep still can't get up to the high pasture, so they're on hay.","zh":"山上的雪今年化得晚，羊到现在还上不了高处的草场，只能喂干草。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk1"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk1"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk1.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk1"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk1.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk1"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk2","type":"actor/person/child","name":{"en":"Paula Lilymere","zh":"保拉·百合湖"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.highmoor.home-1","x":2,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":15,"household":"altar.highmoor.h0","purse":1,"favourite":"item/vessel/flask/holy_water"},"tags":["minor"],"contents":["altar.highmoor.folk2.coin0"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.ponytail","face":"face.soft","outfit":"outfit.dress","shoes":"shoes.buckled"},"colors":{"skin":"fair","hair":"chestnut","eyes":"bark","outfit.1":"ivory","outfit.2":"ivory","shoes.1":"black"}},"npc":{"role":"child","schedule":[{"from":20,"to":7,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-1","x":2,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-1","x":3,"y":5,"activity":"play"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-1","x":7,"y":6,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-1","x":3,"y":5,"activity":"play"},{"from":18,"to":20,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-1","x":7,"y":6,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"My mum says I can't go out after dark because something out there takes children. Have you ever seen one?","zh":"我娘说天黑了不许出门，外面有东西会把小孩叼走。你见过那种东西吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The monastery bell used to ring seven times a day. Now it rings through the night as well, for the vigil, they say.","zh":"修道院的钟以前一天敲七回，现在夜里也敲，说是为了守夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk2.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk2"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk3","type":"actor/person/villager","name":{"en":"Gregory Candleford","zh":"格里高利·烛渡"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.highmoor","x":8,"y":13},"facing":"down","props":{"age":44,"household":"altar.highmoor.h1","purse":3,"favourite":"item/material/gold_ingot"},"contents":["altar.highmoor.folk3.coin0","altar.highmoor.folk3.coin1","altar.highmoor.folk3.coin2"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.tied","face":"face.weary","mark":"mark.scar","outfit":"outfit.tunic","shoes":"shoes.shoes"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"umber","eyes":"hazel","outfit.1":"mustard","shoes.1":"darkleather"}},"npc":{"role":"villager","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":6,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":1,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":6,"to":12,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":8,"y":13,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":6,"y":5,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":8,"y":13,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":19,"y":15,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"It gets dark earlier every day. Our lamp oil used to last till spring; this year I doubt it will see midwinter.","zh":"天黑得一天比一天早了。我家的灯油往年能点到开春，今年怕是撑不到冬至。"}},{"key":"hour:evening","text":{"en":"Done at last. I'll fetch a bucket from the well, and then there's supper to make for the whole house.","zh":"活总算干完了。我去井边打桶水，回来还得给一家子做饭。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The monastery bell used to ring seven times a day. Now it rings through the night as well, for the vigil, they say.","zh":"修道院的钟以前一天敲七回，现在夜里也敲，说是为了守夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk3.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk3"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk3.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk3"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk3.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk3"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk4","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Hilary Candleford","zh":"希拉里·烛渡"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":2,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":55,"household":"altar.highmoor.h1","purse":2,"favourite":"item/food/cheese"},"contents":["altar.highmoor.folk4.coin0","altar.highmoor.folk4.coin1"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.swept","face":"face.stern","beard":"beard.moustache","age":"age.lined","mark":"mark.scar","hat":"hat.straw","outfit":"outfit.workshirt","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"silver","eyes":"hazel","hat.1":"linen","outfit.1":"woad","outfit.2":"slate","shoes.1":"darkleather"}},"npc":{"role":"farmer","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":7,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":2,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":13,"y":17,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":6,"y":6,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":13,"y":17,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":6,"y":6,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"I want these rows hoed by noon. This afternoon I'm helping next door mend their pigsty. I promised.","zh":"我得趁上午把这几垄锄完。下午要去帮邻居家修猪圈，早就说好了的。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The monastery bell used to ring seven times a day. Now it rings through the night as well, for the vigil, they say.","zh":"修道院的钟以前一天敲七回，现在夜里也敲，说是为了守夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk4.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk4"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk4.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk4"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk5","type":"actor/person/child","name":{"en":"Monica Candleford","zh":"莫妮卡·烛渡"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":2,"y":1},"facing":"down","props":{"age":10,"household":"altar.highmoor.h1","purse":1,"favourite":"item/food/honey"},"tags":["minor"],"contents":["altar.highmoor.folk5.coin0"],"look":{"body":"girl","parts":{"hair":"hair.pigtails","face":"face.child","outfit":"outfit.pinafore","legs":"legs.hose","shoes":"shoes.buckled"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"umber","eyes":"storm","outfit.1":"mustard","legs.1":"linen","shoes.1":"black"}},"npc":{"role":"child","schedule":[{"from":20,"to":7,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":2,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":7,"y":6,"activity":"play"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":4,"y":4,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":7,"y":6,"activity":"play"},{"from":18,"to":20,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-2","x":4,"y":4,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Oh, hello. Can I help you?","zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"My mum says I can't go out after dark because something out there takes children. Have you ever seen one?","zh":"我娘说天黑了不许出门，外面有东西会把小孩叼走。你见过那种东西吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Can you hop to the well and back on one foot? I can. I did twenty hops without switching.","zh":"你能单脚跳到井边再跳回来吗？我能，我跳了二十下都没换脚。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The snow on the heights is late melting this year. The sheep still can't get up to the high pasture, so they're on hay.","zh":"山上的雪今年化得晚，羊到现在还上不了高处的草场，只能喂干草。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk5.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk5"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk6","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Jerome Chalkdale","zh":"哲罗姆·垩谷"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.highmoor","x":27,"y":17},"facing":"down","props":{"age":20,"household":"altar.highmoor.h2","purse":6,"favourite":"item/material/frostcap"},"contents":["altar.highmoor.folk6.coin0","altar.highmoor.folk6.coin1","altar.highmoor.folk6.coin2","altar.highmoor.folk6.coin3","altar.highmoor.folk6.coin4","altar.highmoor.folk6.coin5"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.short","face":"face.keen","hat":"hat.straw","outfit":"outfit.workshirt","legs":"legs.hose","shoes":"shoes.tall"},"colors":{"skin":"warm","hair":"umber","eyes":"sky","hat.1":"linen","outfit.1":"undyed","outfit.2":"umber","legs.1":"linen","shoes.1":"leather"}},"npc":{"role":"farmer","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":5,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-3","x":2,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":27,"y":17,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-3","x":5,"y":5,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":27,"y":17,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":36,"y":10,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Oh, hello. Can I help you?","zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The wheat came into ear nearly half a month late this year, and the ears are thin. My father farmed forty years and says he never saw the like.","zh":"今年的麦子抽穗晚了快半个月，穗子也瘪。我爹种了四十年地，说从没见过这样的。"}},{"key":"weather:rain","text":{"en":"Rain. Good. Walk round, would you, and don't step in the furrows I just opened.","zh":"下雨了，好。你绕着点走，别踩我刚开的沟。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The monastery bell used to ring seven times a day. Now it rings through the night as well, for the vigil, they say.","zh":"修道院的钟以前一天敲七回，现在夜里也敲，说是为了守夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk6.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk6"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk6.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk6"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk6.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk6"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk6.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk6"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk6.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk6"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk6.coin5","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk6"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk7","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Bernard Chalkdale","zh":"伯纳德·垩谷"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.highmoor","x":24,"y":13},"facing":"down","props":{"age":31,"household":"altar.highmoor.h2","purse":6,"favourite":"item/food/fish/eel"},"contents":["altar.highmoor.folk7.coin0","altar.highmoor.folk7.coin1","altar.highmoor.folk7.coin2","altar.highmoor.folk7.coin3","altar.highmoor.folk7.coin4","altar.highmoor.folk7.coin5"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.messy","face":"face.stern","outfit":"outfit.workshirt","legs":"legs.hose"},"colors":{"skin":"tan","hair":"black","eyes":"bark","outfit.1":"ochre","outfit.2":"moss","legs.1":"moss"}},"npc":{"role":"farmer","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":5,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-3","x":4,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":24,"y"