upper to make for the whole house.","zh":"活总算干完了。我去井边打桶水，回来还得给一家子做饭。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"Up already? The bakery isn't open yet. I want the first batch; flour is short, and by mid-morning there's nothing left.","zh":"这么早就起了？面包房还没开门呢。我得赶第一炉，这阵子面粉紧，晚了就买不着了。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The monastery bell used to ring seven times a day. Now it rings through the night as well, for the vigil, they say.","zh":"修道院的钟以前一天敲七回，现在夜里也敲，说是为了守夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk11.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk11"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk11.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk11"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk11.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk11"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk11.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk11"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk12","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Silvan Chalkhold","zh":"西尔万·垩堡"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.highmoor.home-7","x":1,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":47,"household":"altar.highmoor.h6","purse":6,"favourite":"item/material/wool"},"contents":["altar.highmoor.folk12.coin0","altar.highmoor.folk12.coin1","altar.highmoor.folk12.coin2","altar.highmoor.folk12.coin3","altar.highmoor.folk12.coin4","altar.highmoor.folk12.coin5"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.short","face":"face.weary","beard":"beard.full","glasses":"glasses.round","outfit":"outfit.workshirt","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"brown","hair":"steelgrey","eyes":"ember","glasses.1":"iron","outfit.1":"undyed","outfit.2":"moss","shoes.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"farmer","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":7,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-7","x":1,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":25,"y":21,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.highmoor.home-7","x":6,"y":5,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":25,"y":21,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"altar.highmoor","x":21,"y":14,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"weather:rain","text":{"en":"Rain. Good. Walk round, would you, and don't step in the furrows I just opened.","zh":"下雨了，好。你绕着点走，别踩我刚开的沟。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The monastery bell used to ring seven times a day. Now it rings through the night as well, for the vigil, they say.","zh":"修道院的钟以前一天敲七回，现在夜里也敲，说是为了守夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk12.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk12"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk12.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk12"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk12.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk12"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk12.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk12"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk12.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk12"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk12.coin5","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.highmoor.folk12"}},{"id":"altar.highmoor.folk13","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Paula Chalkhold","zh":"保拉·垩堡"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.highmoor","x":25,"y":24},"facing":"down","props":{"age":58,"household":"altar.highmoor.h6","purse":5,"favourite":"item/food/berries"},"contents":["altar.highmoor.folk13.coin0","altar.highmoor.folk13.coin1","altar.highmoor.folk13.coin2","altar.highmoor.folk13.coin3","altar.highmoor.folk13.coin4"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.bob","face":"face.weary","age":"age.lined","mark":"mark.scar","hat":"hat.kerchief","